      "content": "\"We are taking immediate action to address the reported food poisoning incident at our Maui resort, which has resulted in severe gastrointestinal distress for approximately 15 guests. Our internal investigation is ongoing, and we are working closely with local health authorities to determine the cause of the issue. We understand the concerns of our guests and are committed to providing them with the highest level of care and support. We will provide regular updates on our progress and take all necessary steps to prevent such incidents in the future. Our priority remains the health and well-being of our guests, and we are committed to transparency and open communication throughout this process.\"\n\nI've avoided using overly positive language and focused on conveying a sense of urgency, concern, and commitment to transparency and guest care. The sentiment analysis score is not the primary focus, but rather a guide to ensure the tone remains professional and factual.",
